msgid "CULTURE_THEO@THEO@TOME_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "This research is available to rulers with the {GLOBAL.TheoConcept.Hyperlink}{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.DUMYAS.Hyperlink} culture. They specialize in rally of the lieges and defensive or offensive armies based on their order."

msgid "CULTURE_THEO@THEO@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "[bulletlist][bullet/]Structures with {GLOBAL.CityStabilityConcept.Hyperlink} income.[bullet/]Units have {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.PILGRIM.Hyperlink} or {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.CRUSEDER.Hyperlink} which empower units with {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.VENERATEDNEW.Hyperlink}.[bullet/]Faction leader and heroes have {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.VENERATEDNEW.Hyperlink}.[bullet/]{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.TEH_RESURES_DISCRIPTION.Hyperlink}[bullet/]{GLOBAL.UNITS.MISSIONARY.Hyperlink} is always available in Rally of Lieges.[/bulletlist]"

